{"articles":[{"no":"第 1 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法依營造業法第四十三條第二項規定訂定之。","id":"D0070144/a:1","anchor":"a-1","contentHash":"649bd18f7dda210afec09b30095f74752b36182df502c46564d6e28626c96642","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070144/a:1/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":22,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 2 條","path":[],"text":"綜合營造業及經中央主管機關認有必要之專業營造業（以下簡稱營造業）向中央主管機關申請評鑑時，應檢附下列文件與評鑑費新臺幣五百元及證書費新臺幣一千元：\n一、申請書。 \n二、營造業登記證書影本。 \n三、公司或商業登記證明文件。 \n四、公會會員證影本。 \n五、營造業評定報告書。 \n六、其他經中央主管機關指定文件。","id":"D0070144/a:2","anchor":"a-2","contentHash":"cdc9ff2088b70b3422f28ca5ff2b956298c7d2fd4e6d14e36447b40927733f53","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070144/a:2/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":153,"children":[{"id":"D0070144/a:2/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":74,"end":82,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:2/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":82,"end":96,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:2/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":96,"end":112,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:2/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":112,"end":124,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:2/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":124,"end":137,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:2/p:1/i:6","kind":"item","number":6,"start":137,"end":153,"children":[]}]}]}},{"no":"第 3 條","path":[],"text":"前條第五款營造業評定報告書（如附件一），由營造業向中央主管機關認可辦理營造業評鑑之機關（構）、公會團體申請發給，其有效期限為一年。\n前項發給營造業評定報告書之機關（構）、公會團體，不得同時為受託辦理該營造業評鑑之機關（構）、公會團體。","id":"D0070144/a:3","anchor":"a-3","contentHash":"e2c21a52f64199deb3cfa5c81dbfde7b9e5ad034785c19234fd58cc02a66d7ff","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070144/a:3/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":66,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:3/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":66,"end":117,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 4 條","path":[],"text":"營造業申請評鑑文件不合規定者，中央主管機關應書面通知其於一個月內補正，逾期未補正或補正仍不合格者，駁回其申請，並退還評鑑費及證書費。","id":"D0070144/a:4","anchor":"a-4","contentHash":"da3afb95afd132c16eb28a852d2cd4a73a3f21cdb1059816278304c1e5db68d4","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070144/a:4/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":66,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 5 條","path":[],"text":"中央主管機關受理第二條申請，應依營造業評鑑認定基準表（如附件二）評鑑，評鑑結果分為第一級、第二級及第三級，並核發營造業評鑑證書（以下簡稱評鑑證書）。\n前項評鑑證書有效期限為三年，營造業得於期限屆滿或於每年度依第二條規定申請當年度之評鑑；同一年度內不得重複申請評鑑。\n中華民國九十九年十二月三十一日以前，營造業得申請補辦九十二年度至九十四年度之評鑑；逾期不得申請。","id":"D0070144/a:5","anchor":"a-5","contentHash":"670e0a05264d3a49ab949f2c2b7282dc4f21a57dbd6f7aa0ef0836b736a74a2f","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070144/a:5/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":75,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:5/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":75,"end":133,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:5/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":133,"end":181,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 6 條","path":[],"text":"評鑑證書應載明下列事項：\n一、營造業名稱及營業地址。 \n二、負責人姓名及國民身分證統一編號。 \n三、評鑑等級。 \n四、評鑑證書字號、日期及有效期限。 \n五、其他經中央主管機關指定事項。 \n前項評鑑證書應記載事項有變更時，應自事實發生之日起一個月內，檢附有關證明文件，向中央主管機關申請變更登記，並換領評鑑證書。評鑑證書遺失或滅失者，應申請補發。\n前項申請換領或補發評鑑證書者，應繳納證書費新臺幣一千元。","id":"D0070144/a:6","anchor":"a-6","contentHash":"8a750f24bd0d9791d745627cf3fb9393b7f352b1d8c72a28899e179b3229b82c","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070144/a:6/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":94,"children":[{"id":"D0070144/a:6/p:1/i:1","kind":"item","number":1,"start":13,"end":28,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:6/p:1/i:2","kind":"item","number":2,"start":28,"end":48,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:6/p:1/i:3","kind":"item","number":3,"start":48,"end":57,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:6/p:1/i:4","kind":"item","number":4,"start":57,"end":76,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:6/p:1/i:5","kind":"item","number":5,"start":76,"end":94,"children":[]}]},{"id":"D0070144/a:6/p:2","kind":"paragraph","number":2,"start":94,"end":173,"children":[]},{"id":"D0070144/a:6/p:3","kind":"paragraph","number":3,"start":173,"end":201,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 7 條","path":[],"text":"停業中之營造業，不得申請評鑑；於原因消滅後，得依第二條規定辦理。","id":"D0070144/a:7","anchor":"a-7","contentHash":"022bc7f6abb5b34d8b66546b55e6a7f3024ffe0482e7d2fe831274e024e6792b","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070144/a:7/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":32,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 8 條","path":[],"text":"營造業以不實文件申請評鑑者，中央主管機關應撤銷其評鑑證書，且一年內不得重新申請評鑑。","id":"D0070144/a:8","anchor":"a-8","contentHash":"79eb2920ccb7eb06151c668d9a9107d97fb1c9bc729631fcea2e6db7d8b5a3d9","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070144/a:8/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":42,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 9 條","path":[],"text":"經評鑑為第一級或第二級之營造業，於其評鑑證書有效期限內，違反營造業法規定，受停業處分者，中央主管機關得廢止其評鑑證書。","id":"D0070144/a:9","anchor":"a-9","contentHash":"210a8e5962713e16be71989c2e9d5157d0d1405fee33e90f8efade6a2d33bd27","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070144/a:9/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":59,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 10 條","path":[],"text":"經中央主管機關委託辦理營造業評鑑之機關（構）、公會團體應於每季將其辦理之營造業評鑑結果，彙報中央主管機關備查。","id":"D0070144/a:10","anchor":"a-10","contentHash":"3775f2cad57e0ab5abdb251832e887337f2b3262583d69671d7c1c7e94176f91","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070144/a:10/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":55,"children":[]}]}},{"no":"第 11 條","path":[],"text":"本辦法自發布日施行。","id":"D0070144/a:11","anchor":"a-11","contentHash":"47b8a3e12a88555780e2c610257366d820f6c2f5ed79aaf37d74ac3e56199b62","officialAmendedAt":null,"structure":{"status":"parsed","method":"moj-xml-line-boundaries-v1","units":[{"id":"D0070144/a:11/p:1","kind":"paragraph","number":1,"start":0,"end":10,"children":[]}]}}],"attachments":[{"title":"附件一營造業評定報告書.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000233745"},{"title":"附件一營造業評定報告書.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000029409"},{"title":"附件二、營造業評鑑認定基準表.PDF","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000234649"},{"title":"附件二、營造業評鑑認定基準表.DOC","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawGetFile.ashx?FileId=0000067589"}],"category":"建築與設計","coverage":"full","effective":"","effectiveNote":"","history":"1.中華民國九十四年十一月一日內政部台內營字第 0940086549 號令訂定\n  發布全文 11 條；並自發布日施行\n2.中華民國九十六年八月二十三日內政部台內中營字第 0960805020 號令\n  修正發布第 5  條條文之附件二\n3.中華民國九十七年六月十六日內政部台內中營字第 0970804052 號令修\n  正發布第 5  條條文\n4.中華民國九十八年七月二十九日內政部台內中營字第 0980806794 號令\n  修正發布第 5  條條文及其附件二","id":"D0070144","keywords":[],"kind":"法規命令","modified":"2009-07-29","name":"營造業評鑑辦法","region":"中央","source":"全國法規資料庫","status":"來源未標廢止","url":"https://law.moj.gov.tw/LawClass/LawAll.aspx?pcode=D0070144","retrieved":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","snapshot":"2026/9/18 上午 12:00:00","schemaVersion":2,"contentHash":"13442171e23370526ef74a03947ff1fdb2413bf274d86c1e178a8bc8fb13c739","sourceRecordId":"CM","version":{"observedAt":"2026-09-28T05:46:15+00:00","previousContentHash":null,"officialModified":"2009-07-29","effectiveDate":""}}